  m_Name: Note5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: The Ruin
  bodyText: "By morning, no word returned whole.\n\nBrother became noise. \nHome
    because teeth.\nGod became a door left open.\n\nThe tower still stands somewhere.\n\nIt
    is waiting for one voice again."
